INFO  2026-04-21T10:18:38 +45198ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_daf8a1c79001n4wr7BId59Ft7T key=directory_blueprint value=## Backend and web source layout
```text
index.ts                 → Hono entrypoint serving API, SSE, and static assets
src/db.ts                → SQLite bootstrap, schema creation, seed data, and DB helpers
src/simulator.ts         → market simulation engine and snapshot generation
src/risk.ts              → order validation and freeze/unfreeze business rules
src/auth.ts              → registration, login, me, logout, and token/session helpers
src/market.ts            → market read models, watchlist, SSE subscription, and news feeds
src/trading.ts           → buy/sell/cancel lifecycle and order queries
src/portfolio.ts         → holdings, summary, and exposure read models
src/history.ts           → trade history, daily snapshots, and highlights
web/index.html           → Vite HTML shell
web/src/main.tsx         → React bootstrap and router mounting
web/src/App.tsx          → top-level route layout and app shell composition
web/src/api.ts           → shared HTTP client, SSE helper, and formatting utilities
web/src/styles/theme.css → Apple design tokens, global styles, and motion keyframes
web/src/components/shared/ → reusable controls, dialogs, notifications, and empty states
web/src/hooks/             → shared React hooks for auth, SSE, toasts, and viewport state
web/src/components/market/ → market-specific widgets and chart containers
web/src/components/trading/ → order-entry, confirmation, and status widgets
web/src/components/portfolio/ → holdings, summary, and history widgets
web/src/pages/             → route-level page components only
web/tailwind.config.ts     → Tailwind v4 configuration and token wiring
web/vite.config.ts        → Vite build/dev configuration
web/tsconfig.json         → front-end TypeScript configuration
tests/api.test.ts         → end-to-end API verification suite
data/trading.db            → generated SQLite data file (not committed)
``` phase=architect decision logged
