- `gol_daf8c1417003nETm0QgTICeg33` exports market, SSE, watchlist, and news service functions from `src/market.ts` and `src/news.ts`; consumed by `gol_daf8c1417009EJxCjmUCbpGl4J` and frontend data contracts in `gol_daf8c1417006yzKBd97XWUnB1s`.
- `gol_daf8c1417004byV0ury23RFe5d` exports trading lifecycle functions from `src/trading.ts`; consumed by `gol_daf8c1417005OMm8nURIiYhG54` and `gol_daf8c1417009EJxCjmUCbpGl4J`.
- `gol_daf8c1417005OMm8nURIiYhG54` exports portfolio/history read models from `src/portfolio.ts` and `src/history.ts`; consumed by `gol_daf8c1417009EJxCjmUCbpGl4J`.
